@startuml
title RF4 — Gerenciar o elenco de 53 (unidades, practice squad, IR) · Máquina de estados: Player.rosterStatus (elenco do usuário)
skinparam StateBackgroundColor #FFF7EE
skinparam StateBorderColor #DC5B26
state "ACTIVE" as ACTIVE
ACTIVE : entre os 46 do dia de jogo
ACTIVE : pode estar no depth chart
state "INACTIVE" as INACTIVE
INACTIVE : no elenco de 53
INACTIVE : fora do jogo da semana
state "PRACTICE_SQUAD" as PRACTICE_SQUAD
PRACTICE_SQUAD : até 16
PRACTICE_SQUAD : elevação até 3 por temporada
state "IR" as IR
IR : lesão ≥ 4 semanas
IR : não conta nos 53
state "WAIVED" as WAIVED
WAIVED : dispensado
WAIVED : claims por prioridade inversa (RF65)
state "FREE_AGENT" as FREE_AGENT
FREE_AGENT : ninguém reivindicou
FREE_AGENT : fora do clube
[*] --> ACTIVE
ACTIVE --> INACTIVE : PATCH roster-status
INACTIVE --> ACTIVE : PATCH roster-status (≤ 46)
INACTIVE --> PRACTICE_SQUAD : move (elegível, < 16)
PRACTICE_SQUAD --> ACTIVE : elevação para o jogo
ACTIVE --> PRACTICE_SQUAD : fim do jogo (elevado volta)
ACTIVE --> IR : POST injured-reserve
INACTIVE --> IR : POST injured-reserve
IR --> ACTIVE : ativa após 4 semanas (elenco < 53)
ACTIVE --> WAIVED : POST release
INACTIVE --> WAIVED : POST release
PRACTICE_SQUAD --> WAIVED : POST release
WAIVED --> FREE_AGENT : sem claim
FREE_AGENT --> [*]
@enduml
